<title>FINLAND: Finnish Sept industrial production up 6.1 pct -SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish Sept industrial production up 6.1 pct -SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industrial production growth adjusted for working days accelerated to 6.1 percent year-on-year in September from 1.8 percent percent in August, Statistics Finland (SF) said on Friday in a statement.</p>
<p>		   Sept 1996   Aug 1996   Sep 1995</p>
<p>		   +6.1 pct    +1.8 pct    +7.9 pct</p>
<p>Six economists' average forecast was for a growth rate of 4.8 percent (range +3.0 - +6.5 pct).</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
